er":false,"text":"In the future, advanced robotics has created heavy robots (\"labors\") for use in a variety of functions: construction, fire-fighting, military, and more. However, though the robots are only machines, their operators are also only human - and humans sometimes turn to crime. Since a heavy labor unit can be a dangerous weapon, the police of the future are set to fight fire with fire, using advanced patrol labor units, \"patlabors\". This is the story of the Second Special Vehicles Division, a motley crew of patlabor policemen and -women doing their best to fight crime and live a normal life.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Police","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Patlabor the Mobile Police","english":"Patlabor the Mobile Police","native":"機動警察パトレイバー ON TELEVISION","romaji":"Kidou Keisatsu Patlabor ON TELEVISION","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"機動警察パトレイバー"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"机动警察"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Mobile Police PATLABOR"}]},"trailer":{"id":"G2zsLRDbRmM","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/G2zsLRDbRmM/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}